; The Wax reference generator (see gen_llms.ml and ADOPTION.md Phase 6). Not
; installed; assembles the mdbook sources (docs/src) into the flat language
; reference served to AI assistants, one per-topic file per part. The generated
; files are committed under skills/wax/ — see skills/wax/dune for the sync
; rules.

(executable
 (name gen_llms)
 (modules gen_llms))

; Extracts the Wax snippets from docs/src/examples.md into a JSON array for the
; browser playground's "Examples" dropdown (see gen_examples.ml and
; PLAYGROUND.md). Not installed; run at docs-deploy time.

(executable
 (name gen_examples)
 (modules gen_examples))

